{"prompt": {"messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "You are a helpful assistant that translates Java code to Python 3 code. The code should reads and writes I/O from the console."}, {"role": "user", "content": "Translate the following Java 8 code to Python 3 code. The code reads and writes I/O from the console. Your translated code should have the exact same functionality as the given code, meaning that it should have the same output for any given input.\nPrint your translated code and also the confidence score you give to your translation. The confidence score should be a number between 0 and 1. The format of the output should be:\n<translated_code>\n<your_translated_code>\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n<your_confidence_score>\n</confidence>\nDo not provide any other text or markdown fences.\n\nHere is the original Java 8 code you have to translate:\n<original_code>\n<your_rewritten_code_2>\nimport java.io.*;\nimport java.util.*;\n\npublic class Main {\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        new Main().mainImpl();\n    }\n\n    private void mainImpl() {\n        Scanner sc = new Scanner(System.in);\n        int n = sc.nextInt();\n        int m = sc.nextInt();\n        sc.close();\n\n        Mod998 mod = new Mod998();\n        mod.init(n + m);\n\n        long phaseSize = 1;\n        long p = 1;\n        for (int i = 0; p != 0; i++) {\n            p = mod.mul(p, mod.mul(n - i, mod.inv(n + m - i)));\n            phaseSize = mod.add(phaseSize, p);\n        }\n\n        long ans = 0;\n        for (int k = 1; k <= n; k++) {\n            long numPhases = mod.mul(m + k, mod.inv(k));\n            long term = mod.mul(mod.ncr(n, k), mod.mul(numPhases, phaseSize));\n            ans = (k % 2 == 1) ? mod.add(ans, term) : mod.sub(ans, term);\n        }\n\n        System.out.println(ans);\n    }\n\n    static class Mod998 {\n        private static final long MOD = 998244353L;\n        private long[] fact, invFact;\n\n        public void init(int max) {\n            fact = new long[max + 1];\n            invFact = new long[max + 1];\n            fact[0] = 1;\n            for (int i = 1; i <= max; i++) fact[i] = mul(fact[i - 1], i);\n            invFact[max] = pow(fact[max], MOD - 2);\n            for (int i = max; i > 0; i--) invFact[i - 1] = mul(invFact[i], i);\n        }\n\n        public long ncr(int n, int r) {\n            if (r < 0 || r > n) return 0;\n            return mul(fact[n], mul(invFact[r], invFact[n - r]));\n        }\n\n        public long inv(int x) { return pow(x, MOD - 2); }\n\n        public long add(long a, long b) {\n            a %= MOD; b %= MOD;\n            long s = a + b;\n            return s >= MOD ? s - MOD : s;\n        }\n\n        public long sub(long a, long b) {\n            a %= MOD; b %= MOD;\n            long d = a - b;\n            return d < 0 ? d + MOD : d;\n        }\n\n        public long mul(long a, long b) {\n            return (a * b) % MOD;\n        }\n\n        private long pow(long base, long exp) {\n            long res = 1;\n            base %= MOD;\n            while (exp > 0) {\n                if ((exp & 1) == 1) res = mul(res, base);\n                base = mul(base, base);\n                exp >>= 1;\n            }\n            return res;\n        }\n    }\n}\n</your_rewritten_code_2>\n</original_code>\n"}], "temp": 0, "sample_size": 1, "logprobs": true, "model": "qwen/qwen3-coder-next"}, "response": {"samples": [{"content": "<translated_code>\nimport sys\n\nMOD = 998244353\n\ndef mod_pow(base, exp, mod):\n    res = 1\n    base %= mod\n    while exp > 0:\n        if (exp & 1) == 1:\n            res = (res * base) % mod\n        base = (base * base) % mod\n        exp >>= 1\n    return res\n\ndef mod_inv(x, mod):\n    return mod_pow(x, mod - 2, mod)\n\nclass Mod998:\n    def __init__(self):\n        self.fact = None\n        self.invFact = None\n    \n    def init(self, max_val):\n        self.fact = [1] * (max_val + 1)\n        self.invFact = [1] * (max_val + 1)\n        \n        for i in range(1, max_val + 1):\n            self.fact[i] = (self.fact[i - 1] * i) % MOD\n        \n        self.invFact[max_val] = mod_pow(self.fact[max_val], MOD - 2, MOD)\n        \n        for i in range(max_val, 0, -1):\n            self.invFact[i - 1] = (self.invFact[i] * i) % MOD\n    \n    def ncr(self, n, r):\n        if r < 0 or r > n:\n            return 0\n        return (self.fact[n] * self.invFact[r] % MOD) * self.invFact[n - r] % MOD\n    \n    def inv(self, x):\n        return mod_inv(x, MOD)\n    \n    def add(self, a, b):\n        a %= MOD\n        b %= MOD\n        s = a + b\n        return s - MOD if s >= MOD else s\n    \n    def sub(self, a, b):\n        a %= MOD\n        b %= MOD\n        d = a - b\n        return d + MOD if d < 0 else d\n    \n    def mul(self, a, b):\n        return (a * b) % MOD\n\ndef main():\n    data = sys.stdin.read().split()\n    n = int(data[0])\n    m = int(data[1])\n    \n    mod = Mod998()\n    mod.init(n + m)\n    \n    phaseSize = 1\n    p = 1\n    i = 0\n    while p != 0:\n        p = mod.mul(p, mod.mul(n - i, mod.inv(n + m - i)))\n        phaseSize = mod.add(phaseSize, p)\n        i += 1\n    \n    ans = 0\n    for k in range(1, n + 1):\n        numPhases = mod.mul(m + k, mod.inv(k))\n        term = mod.mul(mod.ncr(n, k), mod.mul(numPhases, phaseSize))\n        if k % 2 == 1:\n            ans = mod.add(ans, term)\n        else:\n            ans = mod.sub(ans, term)\n    \n    print(ans)\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n0.98\n</confidence>", "token_logprobs": [-8.487341256113723e-05, -8.344646857949556e-07, -4.768370445162873e-07, -0.44476962089538574, -0.0005109196645207703, -0.0004020121123176068, -0.5457857847213745, -2.622600959512056e-06, -1.1920928244535389e-07, 0.0, -2.3841855067985307e-07, -7.152555099310121e-07, -1.311301275563892e-06, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -1.0847986231965479e-05, -9.107174992095679e-05, -1.1920858014491387e-05, -3.814